	(text "I2C: SDA = GPIO5, SCL = GPIO6, verified by I2C scan on hardware 2026-10-05.\nADS1115 ADDR->GND sets 0x48; onboard SSD1306 OLED shares this bus at 0x3C\n(not shown, built into U2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300 30 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1dba16cb-6da9-46f2-9c7d-020df8b5c036")
	)
	(text "Layout mirrors physical build order left to right: battery -> fuse ->\nprotection/divider/buck -> ESP32-C3 hub -> ADS1115 / DHT22.\nPROT and GND are drawn as buses (top/bottom rails), like the two power\nrails on a breadboard -- every part along the rail solders to that same\nbus wire on the perfboard."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 210 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "23feb7db-21ff-419b-9845-27c40cef2a4c")
	)
	(text "EV 12V BATTERY MONITOR\nBattery -> WiFi -> HomeAssistant"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "301880c0-5e93-4e4d-a940-5f24d5da11e6")
	)
	(text "J2: cable to REMOTE DHT22/AM2302, mounted outside the enclosure (via gland).\n1=VCC 2=DATA 3=GND. Data pull-up is on the sensor module.\nAt 3.3 V supply, AM2302 datasheet limits cable length to ~1 m."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 355 165 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "81ba2cff-37b2-4daa-a7da-a1e977629680")
	)
	(text "TVS D1: P6KE18A, UNIDIRECTIONAL, optional.\nBANDED END (K, cathode, square pad) to PROT,\nA (anode) to GND.\nReverse-biased in normal service:\nVRWM 15.3 V, breakdown 17.1-18.9 V,\nclamps a surge at Vc 25.2 V (MP1584 abs max 30 V).\nFitted backwards it is a forward diode across\nthe supply and blows F1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22 130 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a60459bf-3967-4274-bbb5-22a1082e9316")
	)
	(text "Reverse-polarity protection deliberately omitted (owner-built, wired once).\nWS2812 RGB LED on U2 is disabled in firmware -- pure parasitic draw."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245 130 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c9a42587-1eb9-4ade-bc1b-031ee066f334")
	)
	(text "Divider R1 47k / R2 10k = 5.7:1 (unit 1 measured 46.5k/9.85k = 5.72:1). C1 = 2 x 1000pF mica\nin parallel (2nF, low leakage). ADS1115 abs max = VDD+0.3 = 3.6V.\n12.22V(flooded 50% SOC)->2.14V  14.4V(charging)->2.52V  16.0V(design max)->2.80V @ A0.\nANALOG GROUND: R2 and C1 return to the ADS1115 GND pin, and that node meets power GND\nat ONE point. Load current through a shared ground path adds directly to A0 and is\nscaled up 5.7x (bench: 15mV rail-to-rail = ~86mV error at the battery)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.476 180.848 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f2cc42dc-7e86-4202-a3cf-76629e29751a")
	)
